</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Configure the module using /A profile in slot 15.  Outputs may also be configured using the slot 15 structure.
First COP copies the configuration data from the /A profile to the generic configuration data.
Second COP copies the /A output data to the Generic Output data - user may change outputs by accessing the friendly Local:15:O data.
Third COP copies the generic input data into a user defined Archiving structure.  ARCH_IN should be accessed for all input values.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[COP(Local:15:C.RealTimeSample,Local:13:C.Data[4],276)COP(Local:15:O,Local:13:O.Data[0],8)COP(Local:13:I,ARCH_IN,1);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
